{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.poster.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.webm?t=1763465318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.mp4?t=1763465318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEEL THYSELF, AND DESCEND!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The servants of T\u0334\u0344\u0328h\u0334\u031b\u0349e\u0337\u034c\u0326 \u0337\u0341\u0321I\u0337\u0310\u032bn\u0335\u0301\u0326v\u0338\u0344\u0322e\u0337\u0350\u0347r\u0337\u034b\u0329t\u0337\u0344\u0348e\u0338\u033d\u0330d\u0335\u0306\u032c \u0335\u0300\u0345T\u0336\u0344\u0316o\u0335\u034b\u034ew\u0336\u033e\u0339e\u0338\u034a\u034er\u0337\u035d\u032c  venture forth each night, dragging the meek and fearful from their homes down into the Tower's abyssal depths, never to return. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to <strong>you</strong> to brave the dangers beneath the earth. Up to you to slay those behind the horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To descend ever deeper... INTO EVIL. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/baff2c42e761ca81b64a98d7381fe68a.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just bundles of stats, every item in INTO EVIL is unique and <strong>actually</strong> changes the way you play. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique movesets:</strong> Swords parry, axes cleave, lanterns still shine when stowed - <i>every</i> item has two moves (and often hidden secrets!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchantments and Curses:</strong> Find items <strong>imbued with dark magic</strong> that radically changes their properties! Infused spells, elemental affinities, mutations, and more - expect the unexpected. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities, not stats:</strong> No &quot;+2% fire resist&quot; here - rather than small stat increments, weapons and armor unlock new abilities and powers to face your enemies with. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/2d117a6c830c803f13bab69c0bae2893.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure that awaits you is deadly and unpredictable - no matter how many times you face it. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected dangers:</strong> The dungeons of the T\u0334\u0344\u0328h\u0334\u031b\u0349e\u0337\u034c\u0326 \u0337\u0341\u0321I\u0337\u0310\u032bn\u0335\u0301\u0326v\u0338\u0344\u0322e\u0337\u0350\u0347r\u0337\u034b\u0329t\u0337\u0344\u0348e\u0338\u033d\u0330d\u0335\u0306\u032c \u0335\u0300\u0345T\u0336\u0344\u0316o\u0335\u034b\u034ew\u0336\u033e\u0339e\u0338\u034a\u034er\u0337\u035d\u032c are labyrinthine and cursed, <strong>changing their layout</strong> each time you attempt to brave them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful choices:</strong> Not only are items powerful, they are <i>scarce</i> and you can only take what you can carry. Foes, traps, and hazards shift each time you die - but your <strong>choices</strong> will shape each Descent as well. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die, die again:</strong> INTO EVIL is difficult - every enemy is a significant threat and cannot be taken lightly. You will need to learn to adapt to the dangers that confront you, or you will perish brutally. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/3618a5e2b2242940c0666a3c123df2d2.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a world gone mad - devils and death, torture and madness await. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Hordes of Hell:</strong> Demons infest the dungeons of INTO EVIL, wielding terrible supernatural powers. You will need every ounce of skill and courage you can muster in order to survive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes turned betrayers:</strong> The T\u0334\u0344\u0328h\u0334\u031b\u0349e\u0337\u034c\u0326 \u0337\u0341\u0321I\u0337\u0310\u032bn\u0335\u0301\u0326v\u0338\u0344\u0322e\u0337\u0350\u0347r\u0337\u034b\u0329t\u0337\u0344\u0348e\u0338\u033d\u0330d\u0335\u0306\u032c \u0335\u0300\u0345T\u0336\u0344\u0316o\u0335\u034b\u034ew\u0336\u033e\u0339e\u0338\u034a\u034er\u0337\u035d\u032c has been taken over by former heroes who now side with evil. What caused this turn? What dark purpose possesses them? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark secrets await:</strong> Learn th\u0336\u0344\u0349e\u0334\u0342\u0322 t\u0336\u0302\u033ce\u0334\u0351\u0319r\u0336\u0358\u0355r\u0336\u0344\u035a\u0349i\u0337\u0344\u0355b\u0336\u035b\u033b\u0356l\u0338\u0308\u031ce\u0337\u0357\u031c \u0335\u031b\u0312\u0353 t\u0335\u035d\u0330\u031cr\u0336\u031a\u0344\u0331\u032au\u0338\u0358\u033e\u032a\u0354t\u0336\u0300\u031f\u035ch\u0336\u0313\u0308\u033a,\u0335\u030d\u0343\u034e \u0338\u030d\u0327t\u0334\u035b\u031b\u0324\u0322h\u0334\u0305\u0349\u034ea\u0334\u0357\u030d\u034d\u0316t\u0338\u0350\u0305\u0328\u033a\u2588\u0338\u035d\u0340\u0322\u2588\u0335\u0301\u033c \u0338\u031b\u035d\u032c\u0317\u2588\u0338\u0358\u033b\u0329 \u0336\u0305\u0321\u0319\u2588\u0337\u0305\u0323\u034e\u2588\u0336\u0352\u0339\u2588\u0338\u033e\u0342\u032a \u0336\u0343\u032f\u0328\u2588\u0335\u0350\u031a\u035a\u2588\u0334\u030f\u0360\u032d\u031e \u0334\u0305\u0326\u2588\u0334\u0352\u0322\u0318\u2588\u0338\u0305\u032d\u2588\u0337\u0340\u0325\u2588\u0335\u035d\u0322\u2588\u0335\u0314\u034a\u0332\u0317\u2588\u0334\u0351\u035b\u031e\u0333\u2588\u0337\u0342\u032b\u034d\u2588\u0336\u0352\u032c\u0354\u2588\u0334\u0312\u0301\u0324\u0321\u2588\u0336\u031b\u0345\u032c \u2588\u0337\u030e\u0357\u0353\u035c\u2588\u0334\u0301\u0340\u0354\u035a\u2588\u0335\u030d\u0344\u032c\u0339\u2588\u0338\u0314\u031c\u2588\u0338\u0310\u034d \u2588\u0338\u0308\u0326\u034e\u2588\u0335\u0343\u0358\u0317\u2588\u0334\u030c\u035c\u035a\u2588\u0336\u0311\u0340\u032c\u032a\u2588\u0337\u0342\u0353\u0333\u2588\u0334\u0351\u0317\u032e \u2588\u0334\u0360\u033f\u0354\u0322\u2588\u0338\u030a\u031e\u0319\u2588\u0336\u0302\u0339\u033b\u2588\u0336\u0314\u0340\u0359\u2588\u0335\u0302\u0310\u031f\u0339\u2588\u0337\u0344\u030e\u0330\u0333\u2588\u0335\u0352\u0327\u0331\u2588\u0337\u0310\u0302\u0316\u0317\u2588\u0337\u0343\u0311\u031c\u032f \u2588\u0336\u0350\u0314\u0322\u0329\u2588\u0336\u030d\u0306\u032c\u2588\u0337\u0305\u034c\u034e\u0324\u2588\u0337\u0360\u0354 \u2588\u0334\u0311\u0301\u0328\u033a\u2588\u0334\u0340\u0309\u0345\u032f\u2588\u0335\u0300\u033f\u0359\u0356\u2588\u0335\u034c\u0353\u0330\u2588\u0335\u030f\u031d\u0349\u2588\u0336\u0305\u0310\u032d\u2588\u0334\u0302\u032c\u0331 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/cb16e5f68538ee378cb0b80fea53486d.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...you doubt? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think this deadly dungeon is a trifling matter? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very well. Try the demo, and <strong>see for yourself</strong>. But: be warned! Those who venture into evil, rarely return... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/9a01d20ba8eeead7b56751c95007a5d5.poster.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/9a01d20ba8eeead7b56751c95007a5d5.webm?t=1763465318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/9a01d20ba8eeead7b56751c95007a5d5.mp4?t=1763465318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Knight Lossaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1893440/30483381e471ccc84bee2f7ee31962cd8cdebae5.jpg"},{"name":"Priest of Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1893440/bd591ec846a6aeb1fab7df226769f3742c926821.jpg"},{"name":"Priest of Bone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1893440/d9da586187d5197cdf9f0c8c1768196e9bd2947a.jpg"},{"name":"Priest of Flesh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1893440/d7a63f8a60db1599b6aa98443959c02aaa487c12.jpg"},{"name":"Priest of Hellfire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1893440/f81600fcebd6f92ecec2f5f940725d3f974ed556.jpg"},{"name":"Demon of Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1893440/891913df69edff51f2fff4c1e1c377334855be77.jpg"},{"name":"Demon of Bone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1893440/107b55b50548ff43706ebf0301db60cc8c13c42d.jpg"},{"name":"Demon of Flesh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1893440/580237d9f5d25b0e1ebf7d012e8c8c6f1f381102.jpg"},{"name":"Demon of Hellfire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1893440/cd1fe09530f4413ad079f7561bf3aad6c29d74b0.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice Varrax","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1893440/dc08ce2f40c70d6c078e8eba8b853fec081eb874.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1893440?t=1763465318","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763465318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/ef8842dbecff1733ef5ee77bd70399ea2f7e0b41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763465318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/ef8842dbecff1733ef5ee77bd70399ea2f7e0b41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763465318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Into Evil has many horror elements, including death, dismemberment, torture, and horrible occult abominations you must slay.\r\n\r\nIt is not for the faint of heart."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2563670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.poster.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.webm?t=1763465318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.mp4?t=1763465318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEEL THYSELF, AND DESCEND!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The servants of T\u0334\u0344\u0328h\u0334\u031b\u0349e\u0337\u034c\u0326 \u0337\u0341\u0321I\u0337\u0310\u032bn\u0335\u0301\u0326v\u0338\u0344\u0322e\u0337\u0350\u0347r\u0337\u034b\u0329t\u0337\u0344\u0348e\u0338\u033d\u0330d\u0335\u0306\u032c \u0335\u0300\u0345T\u0336\u0344\u0316o\u0335\u034b\u034ew\u0336\u033e\u0339e\u0338\u034a\u034er\u0337\u035d\u032c  venture forth each night, dragging the meek and fearful from their homes down into the Tower's abyssal depths, never to return. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to <strong>you</strong> to brave the dangers beneath the earth. Up to you to slay those behind the horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To descend ever deeper... INTO EVIL. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/baff2c42e761ca81b64a98d7381fe68a.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just bundles of stats, every item in INTO EVIL is unique and <strong>actually</strong> changes the way you play. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique movesets:</strong> Swords parry, axes cleave, lanterns still shine when stowed - <i>every</i> item has two moves (and often hidden secrets!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchantments and Curses:</strong> Find items <strong>imbued with dark magic</strong> that radically changes their properties! Infused spells, elemental affinities, mutations, and more - expect the unexpected. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities, not stats:</strong> No &quot;+2% fire resist&quot; here - rather than small stat increments, weapons and armor unlock new abilities and powers to face your enemies with. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/2d117a6c830c803f13bab69c0bae2893.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure that awaits you is deadly and unpredictable - no matter how many times you face it. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected dangers:</strong> The dungeons of the T\u0334\u0344\u0328h\u0334\u031b\u0349e\u0337\u034c\u0326 \u0337\u0341\u0321I\u0337\u0310\u032bn\u0335\u0301\u0326v\u0338\u0344\u0322e\u0337\u0350\u0347r\u0337\u034b\u0329t\u0337\u0344\u0348e\u0338\u033d\u0330d\u0335\u0306\u032c \u0335\u0300\u0345T\u0336\u0344\u0316o\u0335\u034b\u034ew\u0336\u033e\u0339e\u0338\u034a\u034er\u0337\u035d\u032c are labyrinthine and cursed, <strong>changing their layout</strong> each time you attempt to brave them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful choices:</strong> Not only are items powerful, they are <i>scarce</i> and you can only take what you can carry. Foes, traps, and hazards shift each time you die - but your <strong>choices</strong> will shape each Descent as well. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die, die again:</strong> INTO EVIL is difficult - every enemy is a significant threat and cannot be taken lightly. You will need to learn to adapt to the dangers that confront you, or you will perish brutally. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/3618a5e2b2242940c0666a3c123df2d2.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a world gone mad - devils and death, torture and madness await. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Hordes of Hell:</strong> Demons infest the dungeons of INTO EVIL, wielding terrible supernatural powers. You will need every ounce of skill and courage you can muster in order to survive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes turned betrayers:</strong> The T\u0334\u0344\u0328h\u0334\u031b\u0349e\u0337\u034c\u0326 \u0337\u0341\u0321I\u0337\u0310\u032bn\u0335\u0301\u0326v\u0338\u0344\u0322e\u0337\u0350\u0347r\u0337\u034b\u0329t\u0337\u0344\u0348e\u0338\u033d\u0330d\u0335\u0306\u032c \u0335\u0300\u0345T\u0336\u0344\u0316o\u0335\u034b\u034ew\u0336\u033e\u0339e\u0338\u034a\u034er\u0337\u035d\u032c has been taken over by former heroes who now side with evil. What caused this turn? What dark purpose possesses them? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark secrets await:</strong> Learn th\u0336\u0344\u0349e\u0334\u0342\u0322 t\u0336\u0302\u033ce\u0334\u0351\u0319r\u0336\u0358\u0355r\u0336\u0344\u035a\u0349i\u0337\u0344\u0355b\u0336\u035b\u033b\u0356l\u0338\u0308\u031ce\u0337\u0357\u031c \u0335\u031b\u0312\u0353 t\u0335\u035d\u0330\u031cr\u0336\u031a\u0344\u0331\u032au\u0338\u0358\u033e\u032a\u0354t\u0336\u0300\u031f\u035ch\u0336\u0313\u0308\u033a,\u0335\u030d\u0343\u034e \u0338\u030d\u0327t\u0334\u035b\u031b\u0324\u0322h\u0334\u0305\u0349\u034ea\u0334\u0357\u030d\u034d\u0316t\u0338\u0350\u0305\u0328\u033a\u2588\u0338\u035d\u0340\u0322\u2588\u0335\u0301\u033c \u0338\u031b\u035d\u032c\u0317\u2588\u0338\u0358\u033b\u0329 \u0336\u0305\u0321\u0319\u2588\u0337\u0305\u0323\u034e\u2588\u0336\u0352\u0339\u2588\u0338\u033e\u0342\u032a \u0336\u0343\u032f\u0328\u2588\u0335\u0350\u031a\u035a\u2588\u0334\u030f\u0360\u032d\u031e \u0334\u0305\u0326\u2588\u0334\u0352\u0322\u0318\u2588\u0338\u0305\u032d\u2588\u0337\u0340\u0325\u2588\u0335\u035d\u0322\u2588\u0335\u0314\u034a\u0332\u0317\u2588\u0334\u0351\u035b\u031e\u0333\u2588\u0337\u0342\u032b\u034d\u2588\u0336\u0352\u032c\u0354\u2588\u0334\u0312\u0301\u0324\u0321\u2588\u0336\u031b\u0345\u032c \u2588\u0337\u030e\u0357\u0353\u035c\u2588\u0334\u0301\u0340\u0354\u035a\u2588\u0335\u030d\u0344\u032c\u0339\u2588\u0338\u0314\u031c\u2588\u0338\u0310\u034d \u2588\u0338\u0308\u0326\u034e\u2588\u0335\u0343\u0358\u0317\u2588\u0334\u030c\u035c\u035a\u2588\u0336\u0311\u0340\u032c\u032a\u2588\u0337\u0342\u0353\u0333\u2588\u0334\u0351\u0317\u032e \u2588\u0334\u0360\u033f\u0354\u0322\u2588\u0338\u030a\u031e\u0319\u2588\u0336\u0302\u0339\u033b\u2588\u0336\u0314\u0340\u0359\u2588\u0335\u0302\u0310\u031f\u0339\u2588\u0337\u0344\u030e\u0330\u0333\u2588\u0335\u0352\u0327\u0331\u2588\u0337\u0310\u0302\u0316\u0317\u2588\u0337\u0343\u0311\u031c\u032f \u2588\u0336\u0350\u0314\u0322\u0329\u2588\u0336\u030d\u0306\u032c\u2588\u0337\u0305\u034c\u034e\u0324\u2588\u0337\u0360\u0354 \u2588\u0334\u0311\u0301\u0328\u033a\u2588\u0334\u0340\u0309\u0345\u032f\u2588\u0335\u0300\u033f\u0359\u0356\u2588\u0335\u034c\u0353\u0330\u2588\u0335\u030f\u031d\u0349\u2588\u0336\u0305\u0310\u032d\u2588\u0334\u0302\u032c\u0331 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/cb16e5f68538ee378cb0b80fea53486d.avif?t=1763465318\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...you doubt? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think this deadly dungeon is a trifling matter? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very well. Try the demo, and <strong>see for yourself</strong>. But: be warned! Those who venture into evil, rare